{
 "title": "Aster order saga states",
 "description": "Reserving stock moves an order from received to payment_pending, where an unknown payment outcome waits while Aster reconciles with the provider. A verified authorisation with an active reservation moves it to confirmed. A rejection releases the stock once and ends in rejected. An authorisation that arrives after the reservation expired moves the order to compensation_pending, where a void is requested; a failed void stays there, and a successful void ends in cancelled. Confirmed, rejected and cancelled are terminal: later or duplicate callbacks are recorded and change nothing.",
